  "notes": "Census from the Arista sheet, read 2026-11-24. Product Highlights: \"16 x mGig (100M - 2.5Gb) RJ45 @ 30W / 8x mGig (100M - 5Gb) RJ45 @ 60W / Uplinks: 4x 25G\". The Ports row agrees (\"24 RJ45 / 4 25G SFP\", 100G QSFP row \"N/A\"), and the class rows give 16 x 100M-2.5G UTP (30W 802.3af/at) and 8 x 100M-5G UTP (60W 802.3bt). Ordering information: \"CCS-720XP-24ZY4-F Arista 720XP, 16 x 100M-2.5G PoE, 8 x 100M-5G PoE, 4 x 25G SFP switch, front to rear air, 1 x 650W AC\". Port names continue the catalogue numbering after the 24 copper ports; the four SFP28 cages source no power."
